    "caller": "The legacy loader fills Q0 with float1 and stores it toSP10/SP20, supplies e-color-modulate with X4=SP20 to10189c878, and stores the constant result at definition+E0.",
    "wrapper": "The color wrapper receives four default floats via X4. If lower reader101922e60 returns false, it stores them at+58 and sets count+54=1. A single value with null probability pointer is evaluated through vtable+50;10191c180 returns that stored tuple directly for count1.",
    "keys": "The checked native helpers fold ASCII uppercase to lowercase, multiply by65599, append separator42 after the section, then append field bytes. The base and first numbered modulation keys are absent from both complete typed Gromp emitter records.",
    "missingLookup": "The string lookup wrapper supplies an empty fallback when its X3 default is null, and its explicit missing path copies that default and returns false. The higher color key reader stops when the first numbered field has an empty string and returns false when neither base nor first key exists.",
    "scope": "This establishes the bounded conditional default chain and source-key omissions. Actual live config modes, loader invocation, shader selection, prepared particle color and optional external modifiers remain unobserved."
